BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Asheville Runners
UID:event_316889391@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261010T052956Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261013T181500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261013T201500
SUMMARY:Tuesday Brewsday- The Whale
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Runners\nWe'll be living it up at the Whale for the 
 month of October. the run is brought to you by our very own Martha Olsen. 
 We'll meet in the parking area of the Whale near the outside parking.\nPle
 ase come out and enjoy the awesomeness that is the Whale. See you there!\n
 \nThe Whale 3.0 miles!\nGo R on Haywood!\nL on Sand Hill Rd!\nR on Delawar
 e!\nR Sulphur Springs!\nL on Lanvale then!\nImmediate R on Haywood!\nback 
 to the Whale!\n\nThe Whale 5.0 miles!\nGo R on Haywood!\nL on Sand Hill Rd
 !\nat Bear Creek stay!\nstraight on Wendover!\nR on School Rd!\nstay L on 
 School Rd!\nStay straight on Mimosa!\nR on Sulphur Springs!\nL on Lanvale 
 then!\nImmediate R on Haywood!\nback to the Whale
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-runners/events/316889391/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261007T232347Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261007T232347Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Asheville Runners
UID:event_315933574@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261010T052956Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261015T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261015T200000
SUMMARY:Thursday Run 
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Runners\nCome run 1\, 3\, or 6 miles and stay for a 
 beer and soccer tennis after at Olde London Road.\n\nRoutes-\n1 miler:\nRI
 GHT out of OLR parking lot\nContinue around roundabout at Clingman\, and h
 ead toward the river on Lyman St.\nRIGHT on River Arts Place\nCross Rivers
 ide onto the Greenway\nRight on the Greenway to the Craven St Park put in 
 (the dock)\nTurn around and go back the same way to OLR\n\n3 miler:\nStart
  the same as 1 miler\nContinue onto Craven St. Bridge\nLEFT onto Greenway 
 after bridge\nFollow Greenway all the way until it ends at Haywood Rd.\nRI
 GHT onto Haywood Rd\, go across the bridge\nCross the Roundabout at Robert
 s St. and continue onto Clingman\nContinue on Clingman\nLEFT onto Owens Be
 ll Lane\nLEFT onto Hilliard at the top of the hill\nLEFT onto W Haywood\, 
 follow all the way down to Roberts\nLEFT onto Roberts\nFollow Roberts back
  to OLR\nPass OLR to Bartlett\, turn around and come back to OLR\n\n6 mile
 r:\nAfter the W Haywood downhill to Roberts\nLEFT onto Roberts St. take to
  Lyman and head back to the Greenway\nLEFT onto the Greenway\, take all th
 e way to Amboy\nRIGHT on Amboy to cross the bridge\nRIGHT into French Broa
 d River Park\, run the loop at the park\nCross back over the bridge on Amb
 oy and run the Greenway back to the roundabout\nFollow Lyman back to OLR
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-runners/events/315933574/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260801T141837Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260801T141837Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
